Proposed System / Solution

The proposed system focuses on enhancing image clarity using a deep learning-based approach through knowledge distillation. It involves:
A high-performing teacher model trained on high-resolution images.
A student model, significantly lighter and faster, that learns to replicate the teacher's performance.
Image sharpening is learned by minimizing differences in visual quality between the blurred and the enhanced output, guided by the teacher.
The model processes 1080p images at 30–60 FPS, ensuring real-time performance in conferencing tools.
